# Machine-local Claude Code state - settings.local.json, worktrees, lock files.
# SKILLS ARE THE EXCEPTION: a skill is shared operator knowledge, versioned with the code
# it describes, and is useless sitting on one machine. The directory itself has to stay
# un-ignored for git to reach anything under it, hence `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# scratch / probe scripts — not for the repo
tmp/

# runtime reply-target state — never commit
conversation.replytargets.json

# generated NSSM service binary (renamed copy)
setup/bin/

# AI-CLI scratch instruction files — never track
AGENTS.md

# disposable local runbooks (operator convention: *.disposable.md are ignored)
*.disposable.md

# A live talk channel between an and the running thread, not source. It quotes
# WhatsApp messages and voice-note transcripts, so it must never enter this
# PUBLIC repo (it did once, b376194, 2026-09-02 - removed from HEAD).
an-on-errands.md
